  "releaseNotes": "1.0.7 — Align AssemblyVersion/FileVersion with PackageVersion 1.0.7.0 so dependents that demand net3000.google 1.0.7.0 can restore this package (#7778). 1.0.5 — UploadVideoAsync applies Google:YouTubeContentOwnerId only when onBehalfOfContentOwner is true (agency tokens); YouTube.IsRevokedGrant is public; AuthorizationRevoked resets on Account set, refresh and upload (#3794). 1.0.4 — GoogleBaseClass.AuthorizationRevoked (invalid_grant on refresh or during a YouTube upload), tokens.Error; removed the unused protected BuildTokenResponse (#3794). 1.0.3 — YouTube: MyChannelAsync replaces MyChannelID; own-channel uploads/playlists listing, playlist create/add; OAuth refreshes are saved through IGoogleTokenStore (#3794). 1.0.2 — Add IGoogleTokenStore and retarget net10. 1.0.1 — Prior release. 1.0.0 — Initial release.",
